(7520947, 1201505, 147247, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for your lovely comments! This is my first blue ribbon, so you can imagine how I feel :). When I submitted this photo, I knew that some people might only see 6 camels, though they are 7. As I loved the shot, I decided to take the risk. <br/> <br/>To all who couldn''t see 7 camels, I have numbered them here.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1202020" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/145000-149999/147247/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1202020.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/145000-149999/147247/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1202020.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/145000-149999/147247/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1202020.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Hope this waives any doubts :)</td>', 'Thank you all for your lovely comments! This is my first blue ribbon, so you can imagine how I feel :). When I submitted this photo, I knew that some people might only see 6 camels, though they are 7. As I loved the shot, I decided to take the risk.  To all who couldn''t see 7 camels, I have numbered them here.   Hope this waives any doubts :)', '2017-06-30 02:24:36.000000', NULL, 0),
